{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02824","headline":"首春贻京邑文士 · 卢照邻","name":"首春贻京邑文士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寂罢将迎，门无车马声。\n横琴荅山水，披卷阅公卿。\n忽闻岁云晏，倚杖出檐楹。\n寒辞杨柳陌，春满凤皇城。\n梅花扶院吐，兰叶遶阶生。\n览镜改容色，藏书留姓名。\n时来不假问，生死任交情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}